    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a23afd4ea0ffbb4040fea668",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『重头戏，当然是观光啦～！\n彼此喜欢的地方，看到就会兴奋的地方，\n要在有限时间里统统逛个遍～！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c7fd079087ccc08ecdf54a07f69ead8d602e1298a6bfbc2170c5410288076ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
