      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从阪急今津线仁川站出发，穿过地下通道约5分钟……\n这里果然，是最基本的路线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2adf7cb1032479ac757beced7788358556a5d407d48fab4f17929d43b118537e",
